{"unit_id":"JianhangLy__dsh-prompt-library#card-zh","repo":"JianhangLy/dsh-prompt-library","commit":"7719467bee2062de31019b2d1fb2674745574503","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-library 是面向 DSH Web 的本地提示词库，在对话输入框旁提供取用按钮和浮层，也在设置页提供完整管理界面。用户可以按分组筛选并搜索标题、正文和分组，选择提示词替换当前草稿或追加到末尾；模板中的变量可在插入前填写。插件还支持将当前草稿存为提示词、编辑和置顶条目、管理分组，以及导入和导出整库。数据由宿主端接口保存到本机 JSON 文件，整库修改带版本号并保留上一版备份。适合需要在 DSH 对话中快速复用和整理常用提示词的用户；不需要额外配置或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:1878-1898","client/client.js:918-940","client/client.js:942-965","lib/index.js:27-43","lib/index.js:103-121"]}
{"unit_id":"JianhangLy__dsh-prompt-library#card-en","repo":"JianhangLy/dsh-prompt-library","commit":"7719467bee2062de31019b2d1fb2674745574503","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-prompt-library is a local prompt library for DSH Web. Search by group or keyword, then insert a prompt by replacing or appending to the draft. Fill template variables, save drafts, organize entries, and import or export the collection. Data stays in a local JSON file; no extra setup is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:1878-1898","client/client.js:918-940","client/client.js:942-965","lib/index.js:27-43","lib/index.js:103-121"]}
