{"unit_id":"JianhangLy__dsh-prompt-library#feature-1","repo":"JianhangLy/dsh-prompt-library","commit":"7719467bee2062de31019b2d1fb2674745574503","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-library 的功能「查找并插入提示词」：从输入框旁按钮或 Alt+P 打开浮层，按分组和关键词筛选条目，再选择替换草稿或追加到末尾。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:1851-1874","client/client.js:890-903","client/client.js:923-928"]}
