{"unit_id":"JianhangLy__dsh-prompt-library#feature-5","repo":"JianhangLy/dsh-prompt-library","commit":"7719467bee2062de31019b2d1fb2674745574503","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-library 的功能「本机持久化」：宿主端通过提示词库接口读取和保存 JSON 数据文件；保存整库时递增修订号，并在覆盖前保留上一版。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:27-43","lib/index.js:103-121","lib/index.js:187-229"]}
{"unit_id":"JianhangLy__dsh-prompt-library#caveat-1","repo":"JianhangLy/dsh-prompt-library","commit":"7719467bee2062de31019b2d1fb2674745574503","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-library 的使用提示：本地库文件按 DSH_PROFILE_DIR、DSH_HOME、用户目录下的 .dsh，再到插件目录的顺序选择位置；常规整库保存会把上一版保留为单个备份文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:27-43","lib/index.js:103-120"]}
